0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","$L2","enisa",{"law":{"id":"enisa","title":"ENISA Threat Landscape and European Framework","short":"ENISA","year":"2024 report reference","kind":"Standard","status":"framework","summary":"European cybersecurity expertise and threat analysis, distinguished from binding EU legislation and Indian law.","url":"https://www.enisa.europa.eu/publications/enisa-threat-landscape-2024","topics":["1.12","5.7"],"sections":[{"number":"Threat landscape","title":"Dated analytical reporting","text":"ENISA reports synthesize observed threats and trends. Use the report date, methodology, and scope; a ranking is not a universal probability for another organization."},{"number":"EU context","title":"NIS2 and the Cybersecurity Act","text":"NIS2 concerns measures and supervision for covered sectors and entities; the Cybersecurity Act addresses ENISA and certification frameworks. Applicability requires a separate legal analysis."},{"number":"Use in India","title":"Persuasive guidance, not automatic law","text":"ENISA guidance can inform controls and terminology. Reading or adopting a report does not automatically make an Indian classroom subject to an EU directive."}]}}]],[["$","script","script-0",{"src":"/_next/static/chunks/0h8rqv9vsrp80.js","async":true}]],["$","$L3",null,{"children":["$","$4",null,{"name":"Next.MetadataOutlet","children":"$@5"}]}]]}],"isPartial":false,"staleTime":300,"varyParams":null,"buildId":"mMiCr23A_-Cpk0hZkfT7X"}
